## Agent-Neutral Workflow State

`.agents/aet-work.json` configures the task backend for `aet-work`:

```json
{
  "task_backend": "json"
}
```

Valid backends are `json` (local queue, default) and `github` (GitHub Issues adapter). Choose the backend during `/aet-setup`; switching later is forward-only and does not migrate active tasks or settled history.

